OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1791264388
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABuses 'disturbing the quality of
OL,4,Alife' on estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents told the BBC up to
OL,7,F400 buses were passing through each day
OL,8,Frather than the intended 150 or so,
OL,9,Fwith Andrea Gaielli claiming the
OL,10,Ffrequency, particularly of the number
OL,11,F10, was "disturbing the quality of
OL,12,Flife".
OL,14,FMetrobus said Kilnwood Vale was "a
OL,15,Fgrowing community" and the services
OL,16,Fprovide "important connections to
OL,17,FCrawley, Manor Royal and Gatwick" which
OL,18,Fgive residents an alternative to car
OL,19,Ftravel.
